    board(qa): file CF-097 (repo-url home-root gap) and CF-098 (untraced code commit)
    
    Two QA rows filed from the code-factory-docs QA tick; both carry a
    paste-runnable probe that was executed verbatim from the repo root before
    filing, and both probes are acceptance criterion 0 on the row.
    
    CF-097 — the repo-url arm added by CF-085 dropped the workdir arm's
    not_home_repo check. With HOME pointed at a fixture repo, verify exits 4
    with {"check":"not_home_repo","ok":false} while repo-url accepts the same
    path with exit 0, so a project row whose repo_url is the home meta-repo —
    the CF-091 census's largest rejection class — passes the guard.
    
    CF-098 — af67c3b changed scripts/lane_target.py (+142) and tests/ (+68)
    under a docs: subject with no board row, no ch:trace and no verdict; it is
    the only commit on main since 3b2c81e that touches scripts|tests|specs
    without a trace marker, and its ruff-format drift reddened the CF-090 lint
    criterion until a sibling lane fixed it as CF-096.
    
    Re-verification this tick (detail in the lane evidence file):
    - CF-090 holds at 3b2c81e (ruff check . and ruff format --check . both
      exit 0) and no longer reproduced at af67c3b; green again at 780a1e2
      after the sibling's CF-096 fix.
    - CF-091's census reproduced exactly on a fresh read-only live export at
      780a1e2: 866 rows inspected, 384 rejected / 482 accepted, exit 2, and
      the same rejection-class split, including one divergence line.
    - CF-085's guard, its five hermetic tests and the family-divergence table
      (-qa/-pm/-sync/-dogfood/-releng/-docs/-readme/-perf/-review) re-verified.
    
    Board diff is insert-only: tasks.jsonl +2/-0, events.jsonl +2/-0.
    Gate: Tier 1 DEGRADED PASS with lint skipped (no implementation files
    staged) — the documented board-only refusal (CF-031 precedent), so this
    commit uses the disclosed bypass:
      git -c core.hooksPath=/dev/null commit
    The bypass is deliberate and disclosed here; nothing else rode along.
    
